BREAKING: #Falcons pass-rusher Jalon Walker is feared to have suffered a torn ACL at practice today and will miss the entire 2026 season.

The No. 15 overall pick in the 2025 NFL Draft out of Georgia recorded 5.5 sacks, 2 forced fumbles, and a fumble recovery as a rookie last season.

@wyche89 and @RapSheet on the news.
